# QA replay of the newest What's New card, line by line (drafted in the release UI QA pass of 0.7.0, 2026-10-26; each
# line with a preview of its own from 0.7.0 on, owner, 2026-10-27, D4 B): each line pointed at, its preview looked at early
# and at its end, then clicked, which holds it, the pointer taken off the card, and clicked again, which lets it go. No
# line opens the tour (docs/whats-new.md; DESIGN.md §4, *What's New*). A developer build plays it with --dev-view
# --dev-script; how to run it, and what each still must show: whatsnew-lines.md beside this file. Times are in seconds.
#
# No version is named: the steps take the newest card, the build's own release. A card has up to five lines; on one with
# fewer, the steps past its last say "What's New <version> has <n> lines" in the app log and change nothing.

# A --dev-view session starts on settings of its own, as at a first start, so the tour opened by itself at chapter 1
# once the data was there. It ends first.
tour end
# Customs' artwork read once, so a preview staged there has its map at once.
map customs
wait 3
whatsnew
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\card
whatsnew 1
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-1-early
wait 4.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-1
whatsnew click 1
whatsnew leave
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-1-held
whatsnew click 1
whatsnew leave
wait 1
whatsnew 2
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-2-early
wait 4.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-2
whatsnew click 2
whatsnew leave
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-2-held
whatsnew click 2
whatsnew leave
wait 1
whatsnew 3
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-3-early
wait 4.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-3
whatsnew click 3
whatsnew leave
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-3-held
whatsnew click 3
whatsnew leave
wait 1
whatsnew 4
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-4-early
wait 4.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-4
whatsnew click 4
whatsnew leave
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-4-held
whatsnew click 4
whatsnew leave
wait 1
whatsnew 5
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-5-early
wait 4.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-5
whatsnew click 5
whatsnew leave
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\line-5-held
whatsnew click 5
whatsnew leave
wait 1.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-lines\end
exit
